# Binary files — prevent Git from applying autocrlf line-ending
# normalisation on Windows checkouts. The Phase-1 commit of the land
# mask shipped 810001 bytes instead of 810000 because this file was
# missing; bytes 0x0a were silently rewritten to 0x0d0a on check-in.
*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
